    'purchase-cancel': ['Cancel purchase and close DEV case', 'Security', 'Checks that no charge occurred and may terminate a pending payment with the provider. Only a confirmed outcome records CANCELLED and closes the case in History. UNKNOWN requires review. Preserves products and history; requires shop V17.'],
    'purchase-refresh': ['Check current DEV purchase status', 'Security', 'Queries the provider and reconciles the existing attempt without a new charge or cancellation. Requires current applications and shop V16.'],
