    'payment-history-migration-apply': ['Historical payment migration — apply', 'Security', 'Runs only from a reviewed planDigest, restored backups and stopped bank/shop writes and listener. MIGRATE. Preserves orders, refunds, balances and carts. Records only confirmed successes; the journal supports resuming after interruption. Not a global transaction across both databases and does not automatically resolve FAILED.'],
    'audit-load-transfers': ['Load test: concurrent HTTP transfers', 'Tests', 'Isolated DEV/TEST: 16 clients for 120 seconds, p95 ≤ 2 s, p99 ≤ 5 s, zero errors or ledger violations. Exercises replay and the scheduler with dedicated PostgreSQL/Redis. Reports timings, JVM, host metrics visible to WSL/CI, both containers, pool and DB locks. Not production certification.'],
    'audit-security-http': ['Security: sessions, 2FA and HTTP access', 'Tests', 'Two isolated JVMs sharing test Redis/PostgreSQL. Exercises real cookies, CSRF, roles, concurrent 2FA challenges and drafts. Does not test the target firewall; K5/K6 remain TODO.'],
