    'backup-totp-inspect': ['2FA recovery test — 1/2: detect keys', 'DEV backup', 'Two stages: restore the latest complete bank backup and detect key IDs, then enter keys and verify every ciphertext. Requires a local postgres:18 image, JDK 25 and current JAR. Trusted DEV backup only, up to 512 MiB; no ports, rotation, HTTP login or env changes. Each stage removes its container.'],
    'backup-totp-verify': ['2FA recovery test — 2/2: decrypt', 'DEV backup', 'Runs only from a current 2FA recovery test plan. Keys stay in memory and verifier stdin; they are not written to history, env or logs. This is not a login test.'],
